{"lang": "zh_TW", "eventid": "act48side", "eventName": "雅賽努斯復仇記", "entryType": "ACTIVITY", "storyCode": "ME-8", "avgTag": "行動前", "storyName": "神諭示顯", "storyInfo": "文物交換儀式前的戲劇開演，緹緹踏上舞台。有人用真匕首調換了道具，千鈞一髮之際，贊索斯出現在劇場，向所有人發出他的質問。\n", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {"direction": 0.0, "fillfrom": 0.01, "fillto": 0.15, "fadetime": 0.1}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {"direction": 4.0, "fillfrom": 0.01, "fillto": 0.15, "fadetime": 0.1}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g8_templetheater", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$sjoyasorrow_intro", "key": "$sjoyasorrow_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 11, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#11$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 12, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 13, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 14, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "多麼美好的時刻！暖風輕拂，特爾斐的河水在山間輕柔流淌。", "name": "“克瑞斯拉”"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#11$1"}, {"id": 15, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在廢墟與亂石上，我們建起神殿，如今聖火熊熊燃燒，繁花與焚香的氣息在風中繚繞。", "name": "“克瑞斯拉”"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#11$1"}, {"id": 16, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "英雄的詩歌與傳說讓我們獲得勇氣，令我們聚集於此，聚集在這個美好的日子裡——", "name": "“克瑞斯拉”"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#11$1"}, {"id": 17, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 18, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "回想過去，貪婪的異邦人侵入我們的土地，奴役我們的身軀，讓萬物無法歌唱。", "name": "“克瑞斯拉”"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1"}, {"id": 19, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但我們始終懷抱信念——異族無法統治我們堅韌的精神，更無法統治我們自由的靈魂。", "name": "“克瑞斯拉”"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1"}, {"id": 20, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是我們，名為米諾斯的民族，凝聚在一起。我們的意志與信念，讓我們取得了勝利。", "name": "“克瑞斯拉”"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1"}, {"id": 21, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#7$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 22, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "現在，就讓我們將那最後一個異邦人驅離我們的土地！", "name": "“克瑞斯拉”"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#7$1"}, {"id": 23, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 24, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 25, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在吟誦中，帕拉斯似乎透過克瑞斯拉的眼睛，見到了曾經的第一神殿，見到了那片群山環繞的花園。"}}, {"id": 26, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "克瑞斯拉的面前聚集著曾經流離失所的人們，就像在此時此刻，她的面前是觀眾席上或坐或站著的雅賽努斯公民。"}}, {"id": 27, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "所有人都屏息凝神，帕拉斯知道，他們在等待著最重要的時刻——"}}, {"id": 28, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那能夠寬慰所有米諾斯人的心靈，讓大家知道漫長的黑夜與惡夢已經過去，神諭與英雄故事中的美好未來就在眼前的時刻。"}}, {"id": 29, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 30, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_runstop", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 31, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2082_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 32, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.7}}, {"id": 33, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2082_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 34, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "最後一名異邦人已經送到。", "name": "“阿加門士兵”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2082_1#1$1"}, {"id": 35, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 36, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 37, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 38, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_walk_stage", "volume": 1.0, "loop": "true", "channel": "c"}}, {"id": 39, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "c", "fadetime": 4.0}}, {"id": 40, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$2", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 41, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 42, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "緹緹懷著忐忑，緩慢但堅定地踏上了舞台。"}}, {"id": 43, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這是她自己選擇的戲碼，是她自己選擇的角色。"}}, {"id": 44, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她有必須要說的話、必須要唸出的台詞和必須做到的事。"}}, {"id": 45, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 46, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我為我們——我們的父輩與祖輩所做的一切而懺悔。", "name": "“異邦人”"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$2"}, {"id": 47, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "出於貪婪與卑劣，出於恐懼與怯懦，我們主動或自以為被迫地，踏上了不應屬於我們的土地。", "name": "“異邦人”"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$2"}, {"id": 48, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "本應該養育家人的雙手拆散了他人的家庭，本應該守護自己國度的長矛刺向了無辜的人群。", "name": "“異邦人”"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$2"}, {"id": 49, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 50, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我們所做過的一切……我們應該，也必須為之付出代價。", "name": "“異邦人”"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2"}, {"id": 51, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 52, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2082_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 53, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您的匕首。", "name": "“阿加門士兵”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2082_1#1$1"}, {"id": 54, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 55, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "“克瑞斯拉”"}, "figure_art": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1"}, {"id": 56, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 57, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 3.0}}, {"id": 58, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 59, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 60, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 61, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 62, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 63, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 64, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_black", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 65, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 66, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 67, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_open_box", "volume": 0.7}}, {"id": 68, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_daggerexsheath", "volume": 1.0, "delay": 1.0}}, {"id": 69, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 70, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "克瑞斯拉上前拿起了行刑用的匕首。"}}, {"id": 71, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那是自從克瑞斯拉掛起她的豎琴之後，一直陪伴著她的武器。"}}, {"id": 72, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "經年累月的戰鬥讓匕首磨損，原本鋒利的刃上出現了缺口，但刀尖依舊鋒利，依然具備奪取生命的力量。"}}, {"id": 73, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在克瑞斯拉的面前，異邦人順從地舒展身體。"}}, {"id": 74, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 75, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 76, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 77, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 78, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 79, "prop": "image", "attributes": {"image": "69_i10", "screenadapt": "coverall", "xScale": 1.2, "yScale": 1.2, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 80, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 81, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$minos_folk_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 82, "prop": "ImageTween", "attributes": {"yTo": 70.0, "duration": 15.0, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 83, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 4.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 84, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 85, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "音樂響起時，原本應當繼續表演的帕拉斯動作似乎有些遲疑。"}}, {"id": 86, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "緹緹忽然想起，那名遮蓋了面容的士兵，他的身形似乎有些陌生，動作也有些遮遮掩掩。"}}, {"id": 87, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他是自己為這個劇目挑選的演員嗎？她突然有點不太確定。"}}, {"id": 88, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "劇場的舞台寬闊而空曠，讓周圍的觀眾顯得距離極遠。但緹緹依然能聽到人群的鼓噪，他們是在為這齣戲碼而激動嗎？"}}, {"id": 89, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 90, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.4, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 91, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "——“殺了她吧，讓侵略者付出代價！”", "x": 300.0, "y": 370.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 92, "prop": "subtitle", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 93, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 94, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 95, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "還是說，是在為她這個眼下就站在劇場中的薩爾貢人？"}}, {"id": 96, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 97, "prop": "ImageTween", "attributes": {"yFrom": 70.0, "yTo": 0.0, "xScaleFrom": 1.2, "yScaleFrom": 1.2, "xScaleTo": 1.0, "yScaleTo": 1.0, "duration": 8.0, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 98, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 3.0}}, {"id": 99, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她抬起頭，看著帕拉斯手中的匕首。那原本應該是橡膠質地的匕首尖端，在陽光下反射出了金屬的光芒。"}}, {"id": 100, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "“克瑞斯拉”"}}, {"id": 101, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一切必須在此刻了結。", "name": "“克瑞斯拉”"}}, {"id": 102, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唯有如此，我們才能取回掛在月桂樹梢上的豎琴，縱飲美酒，重新回到滋養我們的群山與大地。", "name": "“克瑞斯拉”"}}, {"id": 103, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這齣戲必須完成，她所能做的也只有相信，相信自己的朋友，相信米諾斯人的英雄氣概。"}}, {"id": 104, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "緹緹閉上了眼睛。"}}, {"id": 105, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 106, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 107, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 108, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 109, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 110, "prop": "image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 111, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_black", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 112, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 113, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 114, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 115, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "多麼骯髒的手段。", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 116, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "米諾斯人啊，你們還記得自己的矜持與驕傲嗎？", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 117, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你們最重要的英雄氣概都去哪裡了？！", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 118, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 119, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 120, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 121, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 122, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g8_templetheater", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 123, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 124, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 125, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 126, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "觀眾席陷入寂靜。"}}, {"id": 127, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在沉默中，人群漸漸分開，一個身影自人群中莊重而堅定地朝舞台的中心走來。"}}, {"id": 128, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他踏上舞台，將擋在自己與異邦人之間的阿加門士兵一腳踢開。"}}, {"id": 129, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 130, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$minos_wardance_intro", "key": "$minos_wardance_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 131, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#7$1", "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 132, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 133, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "用一把替換掉的匕首，製造一場彷彿是意外的血案，我們米諾斯人，是什麼時候、從哪裡學會這種卑鄙的行徑的？", "name": "贊索斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4166_varkis_1#7$1"}, {"id": 134, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 135, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_openftstpwalk", "volume": 1.0, "loop": "true", "channel": "walk1"}}, {"id": 136, "prop": "stopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "walk1", "fadetime": 3.5}}, {"id": 137, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 138, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 139, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 140, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 141, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 142, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 143, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2079_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 144, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 145, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "style": "slider", "inverse": "true", "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 146, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 147, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 148, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這才是我想看的戲碼，總得有些我們料想不到的展開。", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#10$1"}, {"id": 149, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "當然，若你剛才沒忍住出手了，場面應該也會很有趣。", "name": "佩里安德洛斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2078_1#10$1"}, {"id": 150, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2079_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 151, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……雅賽努斯的事應該交給雅賽努斯人處理，即使沒有這位……不知名的先生，也應該相信帕拉斯小姐。", "name": "西妮斯卡"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2079_1#4$1"}, {"id": 152, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2079_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 153, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我還是不夠沉得住氣，讓你見笑了。", "name": "西妮斯卡"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2079_1#1$1"}, {"id": 154, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 155, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 156, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 157, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 158, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 159, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 160, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "style": "slider", "inverse": "true", "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 161, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 162, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#5$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 163, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "里底婭理事官！這——這到底是怎麼回事？！", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#5$1"}, {"id": 164, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "讓我們薩爾貢人出演如此——如此醜陋的角色，已是十足的侮辱，還有他說的匕首是什麼意思？我身為薩爾貢的使節，絕不能容許——", "name": "貝赫努"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2077_1#5$1"}, {"id": 165, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 166, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "貝赫努先生，出演這個角色應當是梅捷緹克緹小姐自己的決定。還請您少安勿躁。", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 167, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一切尚未塵埃落定，在這樣重要的場合裡大吼大叫，才是更有失您使節身分的事，不是嗎？", "name": "里底婭"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1"}, {"id": 168, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 169, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 170, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 171, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$2"}}, {"id": 172, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 173, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "style": "slider", "inverse": "true", "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 174, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 175, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "贊索斯……", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$2"}, {"id": 176, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你終究還是沒有離開雅賽努斯嗎……？", "name": "卡珊卓拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$2"}, {"id": 177, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 178, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 179, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 180, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 181, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "53_g16_sunnyday_R2", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 182, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 183, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 184, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 185, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "贊索斯一直記得在山林裡的那一天。那一天，面對著被他綁在樹上的薩爾貢人，他抬起了槳。"}}, {"id": 186, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "然而山下傳來了勝利的號角聲，喜悅的黎博利帶來了全面停戰的消息。"}}, {"id": 187, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "驚恐的薩爾貢人跌跌撞撞地從他面前逃走，他的同胞死命地拉著他，不讓他動手。"}}, {"id": 188, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "自那以後，憤懣便在他心中漸漸淤積。"}}, {"id": 189, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在早已成為廢土的故鄉，土地失去生機，卻還嵌著薩爾貢人的印記。"}}, {"id": 190, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那是他們的旗幟、他們的地雷，而他們那破壞了河流的水壩成了地表上無法抹除的傷疤。"}}, {"id": 191, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "從故鄉來到雅賽努斯的路上，他也見到了不少倉皇撤離的薩爾貢人。"}}, {"id": 192, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "米諾斯人會向他們丟石塊、吐口水，他從未加入。因為只是這麼做根本不夠。"}}, {"id": 193, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "來到雅賽努斯之後，他日復一日地在特爾斐運河上划槳。他能監控運河的水文，卻管理不了自己內心的河流。"}}, {"id": 194, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "憤怒始終在他心中奔湧，尋求著一個出口。"}}, {"id": 195, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 196, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 197, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 198, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 199, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_black", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 200, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 201, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 202, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 203, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而現在，他長久以來一直等待著的機會，終於來了。"}}, {"id": 204, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他握緊了手中的槳。"}}, {"id": 205, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 206, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 207, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 208, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 209, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 210, "prop": "image", "attributes": {"image": "69_i11", "screenadapt": "coverall", "xScale": 1.2, "yScale": 1.2, "y": 70.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 211, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 212, "prop": "ImageTween", "attributes": {"yFrom": 70.0, "yTo": 0.0, "xScaleFrom": 1.2, "yScaleFrom": 1.2, "xScaleTo": 1.0, "yScaleTo": 1.0, "duration": 20.0, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 213, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 3.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 214, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 215, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這是我，一個被關入死牢，即將面臨審判的罪人，長久以來一直期待著的時刻。", "name": "贊索斯"}}, {"id": 216, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "即使在此之後我會因這種種緣由而接受罪罰——", "name": "贊索斯"}}, {"id": 217, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "此時此刻，我也要堂堂正正地，站在薩爾貢人的面前，站在我的同胞面前，向所有人發出質問！", "name": "贊索斯"}}, {"id": 218, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "觀眾席安靜了下來，連那個一直頤指氣使的薩爾貢副使也閉上了他的嘴。"}}, {"id": 219, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 220, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 221, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我在戰爭中失去了故鄉，失去了我的摯友。", "name": "贊索斯"}}, {"id": 222, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我追尋著他留下的痕跡，在尋找他的途中遇到了無數垂死的同胞。", "name": "贊索斯"}}, {"id": 223, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我們曾經有過的美好夢想在異族的侵略之下被毀於一旦，再也無法重建，無法回頭。", "name": "贊索斯"}}, {"id": 224, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "究竟為什麼，我一直很想問問你們這些侵略者，為什麼你們要踏上這片不屬於你們的土地？", "name": "贊索斯"}}, {"id": 225, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "又是為什麼，你們能在停戰幾年之後便恬不知恥地來到雅賽努斯，彷彿一切都從未發生過？", "name": "贊索斯"}}, {"id": 226, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他抬頭看向舞台中央的兩人。那名薩爾貢女人像是要說什麼，但最終沒有開口。"}}, {"id": 227, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而帕拉斯，放下了她握著匕首的手。"}}, {"id": 228, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 229, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 230, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我的同胞們，我時常驚訝，為何你們能遺忘得如此之快。", "name": "贊索斯"}}, {"id": 231, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "百年的殖民歷史，就一點也沒有在你們心中留下痕跡？", "name": "贊索斯"}}, {"id": 232, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "薩爾貢人毀滅我們的家園，破壞我們的城邦，扭曲我們的文化，抹殺我們的傳統語言。", "name": "贊索斯"}}, {"id": 233, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這些記憶難道不足以讓你們對薩爾貢人保持警惕？", "name": "贊索斯"}}, {"id": 234, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "為什麼你們能放下這些過往？為什麼你們還敢與薩爾貢人交易？", "name": "贊索斯"}}, {"id": 235, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "什麼文化交流活動——說得多麼好聽！", "name": "贊索斯"}}, {"id": 236, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他們要帶走的不只有三城建造時期的技術資料，更有我們在建造這三座移動城市時付出的血汗的真實記錄！", "name": "贊索斯"}}, {"id": 237, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他們要帶走他們的罪證，粉飾歷史，編造出薩爾貢人親善的假象，讓所有人遺忘！", "name": "贊索斯"}}, {"id": 238, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而你們，你們所有推波助瀾的人，都是這一罪行的幫兇！", "name": "贊索斯"}}, {"id": 239, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "贊索斯看向觀眾席。薩爾貢的副使暴跳如雷，雅賽努斯理事官的表情卻仍舊沉靜，似乎早已預料到他會出現在此。"}}, {"id": 240, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不遠處，卡珊卓拉正擔憂地望著他。在最遙遠的角落裡，藏著他的學生呂刻伊昂及其同學。"}}, {"id": 241, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "舞台上，主演的兩人表情錯愕，他不知道其中有多少是演技，又有多少是自己的想像。"}}, {"id": 242, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在那兩人的腳下，被他踢到了一邊的士兵也一臉驚訝。"}}, {"id": 243, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 244, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 245, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是的，戰爭似乎已經結束，我們似乎已經可以忘記所有苦痛，過上美好的新生活。", "name": "贊索斯"}}, {"id": 246, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "於是我們從故紙堆裡翻出神諭、戲劇和傳說，興建神殿和祭壇，模仿英雄的行為，便以為自己延續了古老的傳承。", "name": "贊索斯"}}, {"id": 247, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但悠閒的生活真的能帶來心中的平靜？蒼白的台詞真的能告慰逝去的故人？", "name": "贊索斯"}}, {"id": 248, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我所看到的只有陰謀、算計與私慾，米諾斯的精神在哪裡？真正的英雄氣概又在哪裡？", "name": "贊索斯"}}, {"id": 249, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 250, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "69_g8_templetheater", "screenadapt": "coverall", "block": "true"}}, {"id": 251, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 252, "prop": "image", "attributes": {"fadetime": 1.5}}, {"id": 253, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 254, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "周圍一片寂靜。良久，面前的薩爾貢女人向前踏出一步。"}}, {"id": 255, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 256, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$1", "duration": 0.7}}, {"id": 257, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 258, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 259, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我在您的眼中看到了不甘與渴望。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$1"}, {"id": 260, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您希望堂堂正正地與薩爾貢人交手，這是您的英雄氣概。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$1"}, {"id": 261, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那麼現在就有這樣的機會——來吧，這是我身為薩爾貢人欠您的一場戰鬥。", "name": "緹緹"}, "figure_art": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$1"}, {"id": 262, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 263, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_clothmovementsp", "volume": 0.8}}, {"id": 264, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 265, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 266, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 267, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 255.0, "g": 255.0, "b": 255.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 268, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 255.0, "g": 255.0, "b": 255.0, "fadetime": 0.05, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 269, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_metalhammerhit", "volume": 0.8}}, {"id": 270, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_metallicclick", "volume": 0.9, "delay": 0.2}}, {"id": 271, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.8, "xstrength": 25.0, "ystrength": 25.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 272, "prop": "Effect", "attributes": {"name": "$e_lance_hit_01", "layer": 1.0}}, {"id": 273, "prop": "Effect", "attributes": {"name": "$e_slash_cross", "layer": 2.0}}, {"id": 274, "prop": "Effect", "attributes": {"name": "$e_spark_02_large", "layer": 3.0}}, {"id": 275, "prop": "Effect", "attributes": {"name": "$e_spark_01_mid", "layer": 4.0}}, {"id": 276, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 255.0, "g": 255.0, "b": 255.0, "fadetime": 0.05, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 277, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.3}}, {"id": 278, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 255.0, "g": 255.0, "b": 255.0, "fadetime": 0.05, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 279, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_spear", "volume": 0.8}}, {"id": 280, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$swordtsing5", "volume": 0.9, "delay": 0.2}}, {"id": 281, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.8, "xstrength": 25.0, "ystrength": 25.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 282, "prop": "Effect", "attributes": {"name": "$e_spark_01_large", "layer": 2.0}}, {"id": 283, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 255.0, "g": 255.0, "b": 255.0, "fadetime": 0.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 284, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 285, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 286, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 287, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 288, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 289, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 290, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 291, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": ""}}], "OPTIONTRACE": true}